Alex wrote:
> I don't have anything that I am aware of that will let me levitate or
> breath water.  I got by Medusa by digging in the hopes I would find
> something but I have not.  Now I don't know what to do?  I have no
> instruments to get the drawbridge down either.

Can you just smash the drawbridge from afar e.g. with striking? A giant
from inside the Castle may then be able to throw a boulder at you that you
can use to bridge the water. A broken down drawbridge might as well give
one of the soldiers in the Castle the opportunity to zap a wand of cold
at you, which will bridge the water. Sometimes there's a boulder available
in the little maze, that could be pushed into the moat; if it's close to
the wall then wait for a giant to pick it up. In case you could smash the
drawbridge there's also the possibility to jump into the moat, then you
may (if the drwabridge square is not occupied) be put out of the moat by
the RNG; make sure you've dropped your sensitive equipment before the dive.
A random umber hulk may confuse you in case you have some teleport scroll.
You can occasionally get confused as well from eating, e.g. some tripe.

